        customers: ["**Tata Steel and JSW Steel**, its largest Indian customers; JSW placed a group order worth about ₹1,200–1,300cr.", "**ArcelorMittal (including AM/NS India)**, which joins them among the top customers for the group; together the top names are about 80% of business.", "**Other steelmakers** such as SAIL and JSPL, and overseas mills served from China and Europe."],
        difficulty: { level: 'High', text: "A galvanising or cold-rolling line is a large, precise machine that must run continuously at high speed, and steelmakers buy only from a few proven global suppliers. Much of the core design comes from the Belgian group." },
