        salesDrivers: ["**Steel capacity and quality upgrades**: Indian and Asian mills are adding coated and electrical steel capacity, and new import quotas and carbon rules may lift European spending.", "**The order book**: ₹4,500cr for the group (₹2,200–2,300cr for the Indian company), including about ₹1,200cr won in Q2 CY26, to be executed over about three years.", "**Services mix**: quarters with more services earn much better margins.", "**JVD and Volteron**: management's ₹8,000cr revenue goal for CY30 relies on these and on acquisitions; management says Volteron's intellectual property belongs to the parent, and how the listed company benefits is still being evaluated."],
